e":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"あと、これは別の話なのですが index.jsにportやfont-sizeなどの情報を入れる際、そのままreplaceしているため、`go run main.go run --font-size '20\";alert(\"unko\");const a=\"'`  このようなことができてしまうのは問題かなーと思います（セキュリティはようわかりませんが、渡されるjsが壊れている可能性があるのはまずい","ts":"1627378852.440900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=hd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4625d478-f5d1-44be-ac2a-39f5a4a7fc5f","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ローカル以外からでもクライアントのHTMLにアクセスできる\nwebsocketのアドレスがlocalhost固定になっているのでそのままではアクセスできない\n\nのですが、クライアント側でjavascriptを書き換えれば認証無しでコンソール接続できるのですこし:kiken: なんじゃないかと思ってます","ts":"1627378736.438400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8dsW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"046698B6-5828-40F0-B7B7-B26C78BD52AC","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"--addr って名前が良いかな","ts":"1627378617.436500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CmVtT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A73C77EA-49D4-4F3F-AA22-951648CF1AC8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"アドレス指定のオプション追加したいですね","ts":"1627378521.434300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zTYc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9b630da-b1fb-4341-94e5-0111ee3ba653","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"こちらが、ローカル接続以外を遮断するオプションと外部からの接続に対応させた改造です（雑い\n\u003chttps://github.com/kato-k/rtty/commit/993c77cbfb8e24d6ed214d227d213f0a694f4cca\u003e","ts":"1627378476.433800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Swu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b3592fe-ba73-41c9-827e-ef02d783f31c","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ただ、javascriptをちょいと書き換えればつながるので、:wakaranai: です","ts":"1627378066.432600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pJ6gG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a233fc4-6548-45cb-844b-8876cf9eeb7c","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"もともとlocalhost以外からは（そのままでは）つながらないようになってるんですよね\n\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/rtty/blob/main/cmd/public/index.js#L26\u003e\n決め打ちしてるので","ts":"1627378036.431900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/rtty/blob/main/cmd/public/index.js | index.js\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/rtty/blob/main/cmd/public/index.js | index.js\u003e","text":"```\nconst socket = new WebSocket('\u003cws://localhost:{port}/ws\u003e');\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/rtty|skanehira/rtty\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MyO="}]},{"client_msg_id":"65998c3a-52c5-43ff-86f4-393d287b8582","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"現状が危険というのもわかるので一旦そっちに倒すのは :ari: そう","ts":"1627378031.431700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"79OW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c2bedc6-19c5-4891-a814-8e514dff90ab","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ただ、それやると不便になりそうな予感","ts":"1627377978.430100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Xsc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bed16aef-c1dd-41e6-912c-98fcd263f592","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"localhost限定にしたいならそれでよさそう","ts":"1627377921.429100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"okU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0e26b61-44f0-4c1d-89a6-65eb67049a3e","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003c@UDDCM376D\u003e 質問なのですが、rttyはlocalhost以外からアクセスすることを想定してますか？\n自分は素人なので的はずれなこと（または気にしすぎ）を言ってるかもしれないのですが、\nもし想定していないのであれば使っているポート(9999?)が空いている場合、PCのコンソールがネットワーク内から自由にアクセスできてしまうのであまりよろしくないかなーと思いました。下記部分を書き換えたところwsの接続も含めて外部からは繋がらなくなった？ぽいです。（不十分な気がすげーしますが）\n``` server := \u0026amp;http.Server{\n-  Addr: \":\" + port,\n+  Addr: \"127.0.0.1:\" + port,\n   Handler: mux,\n }```\nもし、localhost以外からの接続も想定しているのでしたらindex.js内でwebsocketの接続アドレスを決め打ちしてところを変える必要がありそう？","ts":"1627377846.428500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BP9pq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44fa70a9-8555-4632-866e-c2bb059a66f2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"セキュリティは素人なのでセーフ判定でいいのかわからに","ts":"1627376746.424200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"luUft"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab7e568c-f431-4d65-8749-fddfee3eb240","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"鯖のオプションだからギリギリセーフという所か","ts":"1627376732.423700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XcB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5511F387-8F86-4601-BDDE-212EFBF84BD0","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"柔軟にスクリプトを埋め込めてべんり","ts":"1627376651.423100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eGa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"496bab5d-e3aa-4ff1-bce9-22a05071543b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"スクリプトインジェクションの典型例だ","ts":"1627376562.422500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"05RlB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4989d369-e904-444f-8f10-0f38692fd39c","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"クロスサイトスクリプティングめいてる","ts":"1627376103.420700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zv9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"588fbbca-e320-4867-8371-eae9f4499e17","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"index.jsにオプションを入れ込むときにそのまま置換してるんで自由にjavascriptのコードを入れ込める","ts":"1627375895.418300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fS+Io"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eab08ee2-ed9d-4449-9dd1-ecd166a728df","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"rttyの起動に`go run main.go run --font-size '20\";alert(\"\");const a=\"'` こんな感じのオプションを使うと面白いことができますね","ts":"1627375811.417400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiken","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b1tfc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"841349ab-ca8e-4ba0-9637-835e39802447","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"これ8KBも取ってるんだ…","ts":"1627312131.416400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b6f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25c7daac-aac7-44ab-baf8-08e44562d334","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; The problem appears to be that the implementation keeps the parent directory open while it removes the children, and each open directory has a directory-entry-reading bufferin its dirInfo.buf, of size 8kB. \nああなるほどね","ts":"1627311652.416100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bX7Yf"}]}]
